1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,280
(Bernadette:)Should we tell
everyone not to come?

2
00:00:02,286 --> 00:00:05,486
(Howard:)No. I want to do this.

3
00:00:05,490 --> 00:00:08,460
(Bernadette:)Okay. Well, I'll keep
it together if you can.

4
00:00:08,459 --> 00:00:10,629
Okay. (chuckles)

5
00:00:11,728 --> 00:00:14,068
(voice breaking):
I'm not making any promises!

6
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:18,967
(Stuart:)Glad you guys
could make it.

7
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:19,970
(Raj:)Of course.

8
00:00:19,971 --> 00:00:21,501
(Penny:)Wow, it looks really
pretty in here.

9
00:00:21,506 --> 00:00:24,836
(Stuart:)Yeah, turns out half a dozen
menorahs really sets a mood.

10
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,380
(Leonard:)So, Stuart,
have you thought about

11
00:00:28,379 --> 00:00:30,209
(Leonard:)what you'd do
if Howard sells the house?

12
00:00:30,214 --> 00:00:32,384
(Stuart:)And there goes the mood.

13
00:00:32,383 --> 00:00:34,513
(Sheldon:)Hi. Hello.

14
00:00:34,519 --> 00:00:36,449
(Sheldon:)Oh, and a special
hello to Leonard,

15
00:00:36,454 --> 00:00:40,094
(Sheldon:)who needs to be
mentioned by name.

16
00:00:40,091 --> 00:00:41,761
(Leonard:)Subtle.

17
00:00:41,759 --> 00:00:43,129
(Sheldon:)But you got it, right?

18
00:00:44,895 --> 00:00:46,195
(Howard:)Hey, guys.

19
00:00:46,197 --> 00:00:47,567
(Amy:)Hey.
Hi.
Hello.

20
00:00:47,565 --> 00:00:48,835
(Howard:)I just want
everyone to know,

21
00:00:48,833 --> 00:00:51,903
(Howard:)uh, tonight's not
a sad occasion.

